\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces P19-audited controller retest: one independent session per arm, three rounds each (six generation calls), on the same published fixed-stimulus corpus. Left: both final monitors have the same raw union of 11/12 fault types: nine ordinary-safety types plus two end-marker finite case types, \emph  {unattributed} to a specific monitor property. Gray N10 has no eligible reference failure and remains in the raw denominator. Right: actual generation input+output totals over all three rounds, B 123,663 and C 133,915 (+8.2903\%). No averaging or independent-repeat error bars are implied. Cache/reasoning tokens are subsets, not added again; this is not an invoice or a correctness proof.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:retest}{{1}{2}{P19-audited controller retest: one independent session per arm, three rounds each (six generation calls), on the same published fixed-stimulus corpus. Left: both final monitors have the same raw union of 11/12 fault types: nine ordinary-safety types plus two end-marker finite case types, \emph {unattributed} to a specific monitor property. Gray N10 has no eligible reference failure and remains in the raw denominator. Right: actual generation input+output totals over all three rounds, B 123,663 and C 133,915 (+8.2903\%). No averaging or independent-repeat error bars are implied. Cache/reasoning tokens are subsets, not added again; this is not an invoice or a correctness proof}{figure.1}{}}
